  "label": "bitches be like.. mapped to the sleeping woman",
  "description": "The text 'bitches be like..' is projected onto the sleeping woman in the image, implying she represents the stereotype of a 'bitch' (a derogatory term for a woman) who is only attracted to men for their money. The visual of the woman sleeping peacefully is juxtaposed with the text to create a mocking analogy where the woman is being mapped as the embodiment of the stereotype.",
